    decaySeconds: 0.15
  contentsAnswer: A full case of steel spanners and sockets.
  weightAnswer: About eleven kilos, a normal tool kit.
  metalAnswer: 'It should be mostly metal: steel tools fill almost all the case.'
  packingAnswer: The trays are bolted down. The heavy part is on the left.
  responseAnswer: Any sound is steel against steel. There is no spring or suspension.
  authorReasoning: Mass is plausible but metal response around 9 percent is incompatible
    with mostly steel. Elastic recovery also contradicts bolted trays. No need for
    universal counter-motion cue.
